// ===================================================================
// !! FINETUNE PLACEHOLDER !!  k = 0.8 is a FIRST-PASS calibration.
//   The operator judged it "just about right" in LIVE PLAY on slot 9
//   (TE+RT vs a 3-4 DE) on 2026-08-12. It is NOT final:
//   - tuned on ONE matchup/savestate; other personnel are unverified
//   - not swept with the seed-testing plan (docs/seed-testing-plan.md)
//   - retune is ONE word at 004F4BCC + reboot. Values:
//       3F800000=1.0 max pancake | 3F4CCCCD=0.8 current
//       3F333333=0.7 | 3F000000=0.5 losable | ~3F0A3D71=0.54 revert floor
//   Related surfaces still to tune: T1 shed cadence, T2 swim-only,
//   R11a/b losability+move-at-angle (docs/double-team-requirements.md).
// ===================================================================
// --- T3 fold-scale tail (k at 004F4BCC; retune this one word) ---
