// ===================================================================
// C1 eligibility (see 14F8B841.c1-eligibility-diag.pnach and
// docs/block-dominance-requirements.md). Force every defender eligible
// as a block target: the state filter's admit branch, made always-taken.
//   001F2D60  12C0000F beq s6,zero -> 1000000F beq zero,zero (same target)
// Operator-confirmed live 2026-08-12: pulling guard now takes the right
// man; O-line does NOT chase DBs (finder is nearest-in-cone). Diagnostic
// C1-FULL; C1b scoping pending a regression sweep.
patch=1,EE,001F2D60,word,1000000F

// ===================================================================
// W1 -- give the WR a real blocking pairing arm (docs/fb-wr-blocking.md
// Gate D; docs/block-dominance-requirements.md WR). The blocker-position
// pairing table 0x00583860 gives every skill position a bespoke arm
// EXCEPT the WR, whose slot points at the do-nothing default 0x001F3848.
// Repoint it to the TE/tackle arm 0x001F3518. DATA word (no code cache).
//   0x00583868: 0x001F3848 (default) -> 0x001F3518 (TE/tackle arm)
// !! UNVERIFIED -- DISABLED. A controlled A/B on the sweep savestate
// found W1 ON vs OFF "indistinguishable" by eye (docs/block-dominance-
// requirements.md, W1 RESULT). Do NOT ship until an objective harness
// measurement (kind-4 contact frames / gap / angle, OFF vs ON) settles
// it. Re-enable by uncommenting the line below only after that.
// patch=1,EE,00583868,word,001F3518
